1
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:53,020
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,870
[Episode 27]

3
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,840
It's okay if you've done something wrong.

4
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,650
Just fix it in time.

5
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:58,520
It's not too late.

6
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,100
Too late.

7
00:01:00,460 --> 00:01:01,460
I'm pregnant.

8
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:04,120
It's Liu Yang's.

9
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Less than a month.

10
00:01:18,360 --> 00:01:21,450
[Fire Hydrant]

11
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:24,050
Get an abortion.

12
00:01:27,230 --> 00:01:29,030
It's early, so you won't suffer.

13
00:01:30,280 --> 00:01:32,080
You think I'm trying to trap you?

14
00:01:32,710 --> 00:01:33,640
You think I love you

15
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,170
and have to give you a child?

16
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,300
I want a child.

17
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,280
I want a girl.

18
00:01:44,350 --> 00:01:46,060
My son is already ruined.

19
00:01:47,030 --> 00:01:48,210
Bad to the core.

20
00:01:48,710 --> 00:01:50,310
I can't control him anymore.

21
00:01:52,470 --> 00:01:54,130
These days I've been with you,

22
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:56,860
I know what kind of man you are.

23
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,620
You're ruthless,

24
00:01:59,650 --> 00:02:01,380
but you're also soft-hearted.

25
00:02:01,620 --> 00:02:03,350
If it weren't for her poor body,

26
00:02:04,370 --> 00:02:06,310
you wouldn't be with me. I know.

27
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:09,840
You don't have a say in this.

28
00:02:10,130 --> 00:02:11,150
It's my own business.

29
00:02:11,150 --> 00:02:12,350
I make the decisions.

30
00:02:12,710 --> 00:02:13,910
I have a factory now.

31
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,150
I have money.

32
00:02:17,300 --> 00:02:18,250
I can leave you,

33
00:02:19,530 --> 00:02:20,620
but I want the baby.

34
00:02:30,470 --> 00:02:31,680
Don't you want

35
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:35,800
a child of your own in your life?

36
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:22,340
[Golden Imperial Dance Hall]

37
00:04:36,890 --> 00:04:39,090
How much is left in our savings account?

38
00:04:42,630 --> 00:04:43,720
Do you need money?

39
00:04:45,620 --> 00:04:46,350
Just asking.

40
00:04:51,810 --> 00:04:53,140
Have you been drinking?

41
00:05:00,430 --> 00:05:02,630
I want to go south with you sooner.

42
00:05:46,950 --> 00:05:47,630
Hello?

43
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:50,159
Isn't this Mr. Liu?

44
00:05:51,310 --> 00:05:52,640
Stop wasting your time.

45
00:05:52,690 --> 00:05:54,220
You won't find those goods.

46
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,650
If you really want them,

47
00:05:55,650 --> 00:05:56,800
let's make a deal.

48
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:59,270
If the price's right, it's yours.

49
00:05:59,270 --> 00:06:01,240
Fine, name your price.

50
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:01,980
You tell me.

51
00:06:04,480 --> 00:06:06,300
I'll give you 30% after selling them.

52
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:07,180
Fair enough?

53
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:08,620
Fifty-fifty.

54
00:06:09,700 --> 00:06:11,630
You're taking too much advantage.

55
00:06:12,680 --> 00:06:14,570
Wait. Don't forget.

56
00:06:15,180 --> 00:06:17,430
Your wife's seriously ill.

57
00:06:17,750 --> 00:06:20,150
If she finds out
you've got a kid on the side,

58
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,410
she'll drop dead on the spot.

59
00:06:22,510 --> 00:06:23,620
No matter what,

60
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:25,060
you'd better thank me here

61
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:26,460
for keeping your secret.

62
00:06:31,500 --> 00:06:33,830
I know you've tied up money
in these goods.

63
00:06:34,020 --> 00:06:35,470
I'm not in a hurry anyway.

64
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,770
If you are,

65
00:06:36,770 --> 00:06:38,000
give me another 10%.

66
00:06:38,290 --> 00:06:39,480
Let's meet halfway.

67
00:06:40,110 --> 00:06:41,610
But let me make it clear.

68
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,600
We are in the same boat.

69
00:06:45,740 --> 00:06:47,010
If I get the death penalty,

70
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:48,270
you'll get life.

71
00:06:51,630 --> 00:06:53,430
Then I need to see my goods first.

72
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:54,010
Okay.

73
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:56,270
Come alone.

74
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:59,570
The cops are keeping an eye
on these goods lately.

75
00:06:59,570 --> 00:07:01,070
Don't get cocky
and screw up at the last minute.

76
00:07:01,070 --> 00:07:02,800
What happens stays between us.

77
00:08:08,890 --> 00:08:12,740
[Tiecheng Station Welcomes Passengers
Railway Service for the People]

78
00:08:11,070 --> 00:08:11,870
Let's go, sir.

79
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:15,570
You're here.

80
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:21,450
I want a hair wash.

81
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:22,800
Hair wash.

82
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:38,600
How was Guangzhou? Was it fun?

83
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,950
In Guangzhou,

84
00:08:41,110 --> 00:08:42,460
they speak Cantonese.

85
00:08:43,150 --> 00:08:44,430
You're what they call

86
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,980
a "Leng Nui"—a pretty girl.

87
00:08:45,980 --> 00:08:47,220
What about you?

88
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,080
"Pok gai."

89
00:08:49,250 --> 00:08:50,380
What does that mean?

90
00:08:50,510 --> 00:08:51,910
It means going shopping.

91
00:08:54,130 --> 00:08:57,300
Pretty girls love shopping, right?

92
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:03,500
I heard the girls in Guangzhou

93
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:05,560
are really pretty. Are they?

94
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,850
Not as pretty as you.

95
00:09:07,850 --> 00:09:08,780
That's for sure.

96
00:09:11,980 --> 00:09:12,720
Well...

97
00:09:17,270 --> 00:09:18,030
What is it?

98
00:09:20,410 --> 00:09:21,270
Hand cream.

99
00:09:24,170 --> 00:09:25,910
Your hands are always in water.

100
00:09:26,670 --> 00:09:27,580
Use this.

101
00:09:27,580 --> 00:09:29,240
It works better than clam oil.

102
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:40,300
Big cities are great.

103
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:42,010
So many good things.

104
00:09:42,760 --> 00:09:43,660
Thanks.

105
00:09:47,890 --> 00:09:48,700
Well...

106
00:09:53,980 --> 00:09:55,410
I didn't drink today.

107
00:10:06,690 --> 00:10:07,490
Honey.

108
00:10:10,410 --> 00:10:11,790
Brother Yan'er is here.

109
00:10:13,130 --> 00:10:14,130
Here, smell this.

110
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:14,910
Brother Yan'er

111
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:16,600
brought me this hand cream from Guangzhou.

112
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,700
Doesn't it smell good?

113
00:10:17,700 --> 00:10:18,500
Smells great.

114
00:10:18,790 --> 00:10:20,190
Thanks, Brother Yan'er.

115
00:10:21,130 --> 00:10:21,920
Here, honey.

116
00:10:22,270 --> 00:10:24,090
Why did you bring me food again?

117
00:10:24,580 --> 00:10:26,340
Pig trotters. Super tender.

118
00:10:26,340 --> 00:10:28,400
More food? I've gotten fat.

119
00:10:28,860 --> 00:10:30,620
You're not fat. You look great.

120
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:32,840
-Look, my waist is thicker.
-How about this?

121
00:10:32,840 --> 00:10:34,500
I'll buy you a dress tomorrow.

122
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:35,870
Alright.

123
00:10:36,530 --> 00:10:37,030
Brother Yan'er.

124
00:10:37,030 --> 00:10:38,790
Come have some pig trotters. They're hot.

125
00:10:38,790 --> 00:10:40,240
I'll pass. I'm on a diet.

126
00:10:40,650 --> 00:10:41,860
Why are you on a diet?

127
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:42,870
Come on, have some.

128
00:10:42,870 --> 00:10:44,130
Dong is looking for me.

129
00:10:45,010 --> 00:10:45,600
Alright.

130
00:10:46,830 --> 00:10:48,820
I'll use your back door as a shortcut.

131
00:10:48,820 --> 00:10:49,530
Go ahead.

132
00:10:52,030 --> 00:10:53,720
Smell it. Does it smell good?

133
00:10:53,720 --> 00:10:54,340
Yes.

134
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:56,170
It does smell good.

135
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:56,960
By the way,

136
00:10:58,220 --> 00:10:59,750
I've got two movie tickets.

137
00:10:59,980 --> 00:11:01,460
I don't feel like watching.

138
00:11:01,460 --> 00:11:02,990
You and your husband can go.

139
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:05,090
Okay, thanks.

140
00:11:05,460 --> 00:11:06,310
I'm off.

141
00:11:06,670 --> 00:11:07,600
Take care.

142
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:11,040
Brother Yan'er's a nice guy.

143
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:12,600
You haven't eaten either, right?

144
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,370
Not yet.

145
00:11:13,370 --> 00:11:14,700
I was waiting to eat with you.

146
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:15,340
Then you eat.

147
00:11:15,340 --> 00:11:16,370
I...

148
00:11:16,370 --> 00:11:17,390
I'll just use my hands.

149
00:11:17,390 --> 00:11:17,940
Is it hot?

150
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:19,270
It's not hot. It's fine.

151
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,860
Get me something vegetarian next time.

152
00:11:21,860 --> 00:11:24,030
Eating meat every day,

153
00:11:24,340 --> 00:11:24,910
have I gotten fat?

154
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:26,370
Tell me, have I gotten fat?

155
00:11:52,980 --> 00:11:54,100
I have to say,

156
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,200
Zhao's place is really hard to find.

157
00:11:59,220 --> 00:12:01,950
Zhao Changyou's been
dead almost a year now, huh?

158
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,170
My pelts—he just left them sitting there.

159
00:12:04,170 --> 00:12:06,430
They've gotta be chewed up by bugs by now.

160
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:10,340
Dong.

161
00:12:11,480 --> 00:12:12,810
Take me to work with you.

162
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:15,460
Let me make some money.

163
00:12:17,270 --> 00:12:19,340
This business of mine is complicated.

164
00:12:19,340 --> 00:12:20,730
How to grade the goods,

165
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:22,110
how much to sell for,

166
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:23,480
who to sell to,

167
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,740
where to make the deal—

168
00:12:25,010 --> 00:12:26,030
do you get it?

169
00:12:27,890 --> 00:12:28,910
I can learn.

170
00:12:30,270 --> 00:12:32,530
If you wanna learn, I'd have to teach you.

171
00:12:38,410 --> 00:12:41,340
You're not planning to do
just this one deal, are you?

172
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,770
What do you mean?

173
00:12:47,600 --> 00:12:49,100
Zhao Changyou's dead.

174
00:12:50,580 --> 00:12:51,500
The line's cut.

175
00:12:53,130 --> 00:12:55,000
Right now, I'm the only one who can

176
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:55,840
reconnect it.

177
00:13:01,170 --> 00:13:02,630
I'll be straight with you.

178
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:05,790
There's still a batch of goods
in the mountains.

179
00:13:05,790 --> 00:13:06,530
More goods?

180
00:13:07,170 --> 00:13:09,630
I couldn't move it out
when the fire started.

181
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:12,840
It's all hidden in a cave.

182
00:13:15,470 --> 00:13:17,020
If you bring me in,

183
00:13:17,630 --> 00:13:18,500
when the chance comes,

184
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:19,910
I'll get it out for you.

185
00:13:22,040 --> 00:13:23,800
Forget it, bro.

186
00:13:24,650 --> 00:13:27,350
You're doing fine as Chen Hong's kept boy.

187
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:29,670
Life's comfortable, huh?

188
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:31,270
Listen to me.

189
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:33,910
It's dangerous and cold in the mountains.

190
00:13:34,270 --> 00:13:36,070
Why keep running into the woods?

191
00:13:36,770 --> 00:13:37,510
Which way?

192
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:41,680
Let's go.

193
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,280
You're not coming in?

194
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,520
That guy always hanging around my sister—

195
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,500
you know him?

196
00:14:19,890 --> 00:14:20,630
Who?

197
00:14:21,770 --> 00:14:22,530
He Liang.

198
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:25,740
From
the Yingjin Criminal Investigation Unit.

199
00:14:25,740 --> 00:14:27,800
They followed Zhao Changyou's trail

200
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,420
and traced it to us.

201
00:14:29,650 --> 00:14:31,670
I figure they've suspected me for a while.

202
00:14:31,670 --> 00:14:34,150
I don't feel safe under

203
00:14:34,150 --> 00:14:34,890
their noses.

204
00:14:35,480 --> 00:14:36,740
So I wanna make some money

205
00:14:36,740 --> 00:14:37,600
and get out.

206
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:41,250
One at home, one on the side.

207
00:14:41,770 --> 00:14:43,370
You really willing to leave?

208
00:14:47,980 --> 00:14:49,780
You've met my wife, haven't you?

209
00:14:52,890 --> 00:14:53,910
Yeah.

210
00:14:54,860 --> 00:14:55,480
So?

211
00:14:56,340 --> 00:14:57,650
Always ailing.

212
00:14:58,620 --> 00:15:00,880
Going home feels like entering a temple.

213
00:15:13,100 --> 00:15:13,790
And with Chen Hong,

214
00:15:13,790 --> 00:15:15,720
I'm not even treated like a person.

215
00:15:15,950 --> 00:15:17,590
To her, I'm just a stud.

216
00:15:20,030 --> 00:15:21,950
After breeding, I still have to work.

217
00:15:21,950 --> 00:15:24,080
Once the work's done, I'll get killed.

218
00:15:32,510 --> 00:15:33,170
Dong.

219
00:15:34,010 --> 00:15:35,940
I've told you everything I should.

220
00:15:36,410 --> 00:15:38,130
I've handed you my leverage.

221
00:15:39,770 --> 00:15:41,170
You still don't trust me?

222
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,290
Bro.

223
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:48,840
Are you crazy or just stupid?

224
00:15:49,600 --> 00:15:50,740
These pelts are worth

225
00:15:50,740 --> 00:15:51,770
some money, sure.

226
00:15:52,390 --> 00:15:53,790
But they're not worth killing over.

227
00:15:53,790 --> 00:15:54,720
Don't you think?

228
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:57,370
You killed Zhao Changyou, didn't you?

229
00:15:57,790 --> 00:15:59,220
If I'm not mistaken,

230
00:16:00,370 --> 00:16:01,900
the three at the forest farm

231
00:16:02,540 --> 00:16:03,870
were also killed by you.

232
00:16:06,150 --> 00:16:08,750
Smuggling this stuff
only gets you a few years.

233
00:16:09,410 --> 00:16:10,870
You killed so many people.

234
00:16:11,270 --> 00:16:14,200
They'll shoot you
with a submachine gun, won't they?

235
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:17,920
What makes you think you've got
any right to negotiate with me?

236
00:16:27,290 --> 00:16:28,220
This time,

237
00:16:29,010 --> 00:16:30,480
I'll give you 20,000 yuan.

238
00:16:31,320 --> 00:16:32,360
Just run away.

239
00:16:33,720 --> 00:16:34,850
Run as far as you can.

240
00:16:35,740 --> 00:16:36,440
Okay?

241
00:16:47,410 --> 00:16:48,530
You little brat.

242
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:50,840
Trying to double-cross me?

243
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,010
You're too green.

244
00:17:05,069 --> 00:17:05,980
Damn you—

245
00:17:24,589 --> 00:17:25,500
Damn you.
